# .cursorrules — Direct File Dispatch Rules for Cursor AI

# CRITICAL INSTRUCTION:
# DO NOT scan directories recursively or run blind greps across the repository.
# Consult the table below and jump directly to the target source file.

## Intent-to-File Fast Dispatch Matrix

- System Doctor & Health: `core/env_doctor.py` (`run_doctor`)
- Universal Converter (PDF/Word/MD): `core/converter/engine.py` (`convert_universal`)
- PDF Toolkit & Cryptographic Sign: `core/converter/pdf_toolkit.py` (`PDFQuickToolkit`)
- Word/PPTX AST Reader: `core/docx/reader.py`, `core/pptx/reader.py`
- Legal Redline Diff (Track Changes): `core/docx/diff_engine.py` (`compare_docx_documents`)
- Mail Merge & Template Engine: `core/docx/mail_merge.py`, `core/docx/writer.py`
- 13-Gate Unified QA Diagnostic: `core/qa/unified_audit.py` (`run_unified_qa`)
- Vietnamese OCR Pipeline: `core/converter/ocr_pipeline.py` (`VietnameseOcrPipeline`)
- Diagram Rendering Bridge: `core/diagrams/bridge.py` (`render_diagram_file_to_png`)
- PowerPoint 16:9 Deck Builder: `core/pptx/docx_to_pptx.py`, `core/pptx/engine.py`
- Excel In-Place Engine: `core/xlsx/writer.py` (`UniversalExcelEngine`)
- Excel AST Offline Formula Evaluator: `core/xlsx/formula_evaluator.py` (`ASTFormulaEvaluator`)
- Cloudflare Security Audit & Sanitizer: `core/security/document_auditor.py`, `core/security/sanitizer.py`
- Declarative Workflow Pipelines: `core/pipeline/engine.py` (`WorkflowPipelineEngine`)
- Code AST to Architecture Diagram: `core/diagrams/code_to_diagram.py`
- Excel Power Suite (Clean/Split/Pivot/XLOOKUP/Diff): `core/xlsx/power_tools.py`
- Office Work & Daily Task Tracker: `core/xlsx/tracker.py` (`OfficeWorkTracker`)
- Excel 57-Formula Playbook & Demo: `core/xlsx/formula_playbook.py`
- Word NĐ30 Polish, Merge, Split, Watermark: `core/docx/toolkit.py` (`polish_docx_document`, `merge_docx_files`)
- Vietnamese Amount in Words (`vn_words`): `core/docx/design_system.py` (`number_to_vietnamese_words`)
- Enterprise Vector Print Spooler: `core/printing/printer_manager.py`
- Universal FTS5 RAG Vault: `core/copilot/universal_rag.py` (`UniversalRAGEngine`)
- Hybrid AI Copilot Orchestrator: `core/copilot/copilot_provider.py` (`CopilotOrchestrator`)
- 7-Pillars Periodic Maintenance: `core/system_maintenance.py` (`run_periodic_maintenance`)
- CLI Dispatcher: `ai_tools_cli.py`, `cli/` (`office_power_commands.py`)
- Model Context Protocol (43 Tools): `server/mcp_server.py`
- Web Studio REST API (:8000): `server/app.py`, `server/routes/` (`xlsx_routes.py`, `docx_routes.py`, `doc_routes.py`)

## Key Invariants
- Tests: Pure Office Automated Test Suites (100% pass rate). Run via `pytest -q`.
- Version: Sync across 10 anchors via `python tools/bump_version.py --check`.
